<title>INDIA: India's IDBI Bank opens 10th branch in New Delhi.</title>
<headline>India's IDBI Bank opens 10th branch in New Delhi.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's IDBI Bank Ltd said it opened its 10th branch in New Delhi on Tuesday.</p>
<p>S.H.Khan, chairman of Industrial Development Bank of India (IDBI) opened the new branch, the first in the Indian capital, a bank statement said.</p>
<p>IDBI Bank is 80 percent opened by IDBI and 20 percent by Small Industries Development Bank of India (SIDBI), another IDBI subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom (91)22 265 9000</p>
